WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.212
- So I have a distinct 
challenge for you.

00:00:02.212 --> 00:00:02.820
- Okay.

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:04.636
- Let's see if you can it.
- I can.

00:00:04.636 --> 00:00:06.577
- I've got one minute.
(audience laughter)

00:00:06.577 --> 00:00:10.210
One minute left, in one minute
can you tell all these people

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:13.547
what's on the one nugget you
want to leave them with that

00:00:13.547 --> 00:00:15.035
they should go back
to their offices?

00:00:15.035 --> 00:00:16.733
One minute.

00:00:18.222 --> 00:00:20.021
You're gonna die.

00:00:20.021 --> 00:00:22.723
(audience laughter)

00:00:22.723 --> 00:00:25.425
I don't know if you've heard.

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:28.061
And I'm being dead serious.

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:29.930
There's so much opportunity.

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:33.934
The people in this room can do
so much if they allow themselves

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:36.803
to play a game based on
them being self-aware about

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:38.372
themselves and what they want

00:00:38.372 --> 00:00:41.341
their legacy and skill 
sets to deploy against.

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:43.176
We are in a rat trap.

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:44.645
We are in a circle.

00:00:44.645 --> 00:00:46.380
We're all saying the same thing.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:51.123
Anytime, I need new business
to grow, I go play your game.

00:00:51.123 --> 00:00:52.319
It's that easy.

00:00:52.319 --> 00:00:53.787
I reverse engineer 
the human being that's

00:00:53.787 --> 00:00:54.888
going to make the decision.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:58.158
I let her or him dictate the
creative and we go on our merry

00:00:58.158 --> 00:01:01.061
way and I want to
shoot myself in the face. Right?

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:03.363
And then I start beating them 
up and saying I sold you,

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:05.722
now we're doing 
none of that. Right?

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.703
Legacy, opportunity.

00:01:09.703 --> 00:01:10.971
Those things.

00:01:10.971 --> 00:01:14.775
This is an amazing time to 
be in this industry if you're

00:01:14.775 --> 00:01:18.338
on the offense and it's
the worst time to be in this

00:01:18.338 --> 00:01:20.580
industry if you're 
on the defense and

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.583
95% of you are on the defense.

00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:25.719
And if I've got one of you to
switch from that shit side to

00:01:25.719 --> 00:01:29.056
offense today then I feel
really good about myself.

00:01:29.056 --> 00:01:31.032
(light music)

